{"3302500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liquidator", "steam_appid": 3302500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play this game and you'll realize that everything you knew about HELL was actually PARADISE. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;LIQUIDATOR&quot; will shed light on the true state of events. You'll even get to choose the paths you take to Hell, there are three of them. All of them are similar to the post-perestroika era. Each one has many stages and even more monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear them apart and taste their blood... and don't forget the secret tilde kick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302500/extras/334769ef31bba1d54ed0b85f21132088.avif?t=1756851420\" width=316 height=172 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play this game and you'll realize that everything you knew about HELL was actually PARADISE. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;LIQUIDATOR&quot; will shed light on the true state of events. You'll even get to choose the paths you take to Hell, there are three of them. All of them are similar to the post-perestroika era. Each one has many stages and even more monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear them apart and taste their blood... and don't forget the secret tilde kick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302500/extras/334769ef31bba1d54ed0b85f21132088.avif?t=1756851420\" width=316 height=172 /></span></p>", "short_description": "&quot;LIQUIDATOR&quot; will shed light on the true state of events.", "supported_languages": "Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app